3. The Physical LED "Heartbeat"
We map an output wire from our core to a physical LED on the FPGA board. We write a countdown loop that toggles the LED on and off. When you see that physical light blink on the circuit board, you are watching your custom silicon processor execute machine instructions in the real world.
